{"title":"OpalBlue","slug":"OpalBlue","hero":{"file":"RawBlOpal.webp","width":400,"height":400},"pageid":2288,"revid":14162,"timestamp":"2024-07-26T16:15:41Z","lastEditor":"Fjsh","categories":["Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Ore","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater"},{"label":"Refined","value":"~$62/Stud(needs testing)"},{"label":"Forged","value":"~$70/Stud(needs testing)"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.51.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"1/3/2024"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>OpalBlue</b> can be found underwater in the tunnel river inside of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Blue_Clay/\">Blue Clay</a>.\nAfter being refined, the name changes to Tide Opal.\n</p><p>It is one of three Opal ores, the others being <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/OpalBrown/\">OpalBrown</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/OpalRed/\">OpalRed</a>.\n</p>"}
